{"id": "EUVD-2026-81684", "enisaUuid": "0fafc894-f5e6-35ab-af83-99499991faba", "description": "BlueKitchen BTstack through 1.8.2 fails to validate the peer-reported endpoint count against table bounds in A2DP stream endpoint discovery. A bonded peer can send an AVDTP DISCOVER response with more endpoints than the fixed table holds, causing out-of-bounds writes that corrupt adjacent static objects and crash the process or sever event delivery.", "datePublished": "2026-09-17T15:16:52", "dateUpdated": "2026-09-17T19:19:21", "baseScore": 7.0, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:A/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:N/VI:L/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/bluekitchen/btstack/commit/fc208fcce056d4e0a5bb916abc90e83a383e1cdf", "https://github.com/bluekitchen/btstack/blob/v1.8.2/src/classic/a2dp.c#L568", "https://github.com/bluekitchen/btstack/blob/v1.8.2/src/classic/avdtp.c#L1703", "https://github.com/bluekitchen/btstack", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/bluekitchen-btstack-through-1.8.2-a2dp-sep-discovery-out-of-bounds-write"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-93015", "GHSA-8jfq-vh53-xqf3"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.39, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "1236a6df-4bb4-3ea8-8487-5dc06567111b", "product": {"name": "BTstack", "vendor": {"name": "BlueKitchen GmbH"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22641.8.2"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "35f68038-8beb-314b-a258-ff592f3687d2", "vendor": {"name": "BlueKitchen GmbH"}}], "isExploited": false}